<messaging:emailTemplate relatedToType="Account"    subject="NOTICE: Uncovered Account Team review required by {!relatedTo.Core_Account_Team_Audit_Due_Date__c}">    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >        <html>            <body>                <p>Hello,</p>                                            <p><apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+'apex/Core_AccountTeamAudit_DataOps?search=Uncovered%20Account'}">                    Please visit this page to review uncovered Accounts' Team Members by                     <apex:outputText value="{0, date, MMMM d'.'}">                        <apex:param value="{!relatedto.Core_Account_Team_Audit_Due_Date__c}" />                    </apex:outputText>                    </apex:outputlink>                </p>                                <p>Internal Audit requires that Account Team Members and their access levels be reviewed periodically. This provides assurance that access has been limited to the Team Members who are working on an Account.</p>                                <p>One or more uncovered Accounts with Account Team Members currently require review.</p>                                <p>For Team Members who belong on the Account Team, set the Account, Opportunity and Case access level (Private, Read, or Read/Write) to the appropriate “need to know” level. Note that Account Read/Write access grants Team Members the ability to edit Contact information and to emulate customers who are IPS Active Contacts. In addition, it provides edit access to non-core Account fields.</p>                <p>Please visit the linked page containing all the uncovered Accounts and associated Team Members that currently require review. For each account, when your review and updates are complete, mark the Review Completed box, and make sure to save your change.</p>                              <p>This review must be completed by                     <apex:outputText value="{0, date, MMMM d'.'}">                        <apex:param value="{!relatedto.Core_Account_Team_Audit_Due_Date__c}" />                    </apex:outputText>                </p>                <p>Thank you!</p>            </body>        </html>    </messaging:htmlEmailBody></messaging:emailTemplate>